Generator Control

Copyright 2026 Summon Software Labs

Generator Control is an open-source, vendor-neutral runtime for standby
generator control and lifecycle governance: generator identity and generations,
readiness and safety interlocks, fuel and resource evidence, synchronization and
transfer eligibility, start/stop/test authority, command/acknowledgement/effect
separation, fencing, durable persistence and audit.

This product is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See the
LICENSE file in this distribution for the full license text.

Generator Control does not collect or transmit any telemetry. All state,
journals and audit records are written to local files chosen by the operator and
never leave the machine running the software.

